    "name":  "LED Floodlight 100W - ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835",
    "reference":  "FLACT100W-CW-91922",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Floodlight 100W\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cb\u003e- ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835 - IP65\u003c/b\u003e: The perfect choice for powerful and durable lighting. This 100W LED projector, equipped with cutting-edge OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835 technology, offers bright and efficient lighting. With its IP65 rating, it is water and dust resistant, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the exceptional quality and performance of this category-leading floodlight!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Floodlight 100W - ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLED Floodlight - ACTION PRO - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E2835\u003c/strong\u003e. 100W power, aluminum and glass construction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMD2835 Osram Duris, CRI \u0026gt; 80. IP65, water and dust resistant. Epoxy paint coating. Easy installation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses: Outdoor lighting, security, events, displays, indoors.\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty.\u003c/p\u003e",
